5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I hate walking past the corner in August. It smells terrible.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,We need to know the costs before we agree to anything.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We still have to live here together. Let's keep it simple.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,Who is actually doing the work? I want to know the hours.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,One house has suffered for years. We need fairness.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, do you think we can just move it?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, that is a valid point. We must be fair.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Moving it might just move the problem, not solve it.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I am not volunteering to be the phone answerer again.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"If we build something, who pays for the maintenance?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I want to see what the other blocks did.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will check the ledger and the subsidy info.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the complaint log and the frontages.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I need the truck times and the supervised morning data.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the filing requirements and the station minutes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Okay, let's see what we find.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,Agreed. Let's get the facts.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let's not overcomplicate this.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I am ready to look into the details.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will review the legal and historical records.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
