35,2,1,talk,Rin,,The station block's bin house smells worse than the open pile.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,The subsidy only covers forty percent. The rest is on us.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The complaint log shows one house filed eleven of fourteen.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,The truck comes at seven forty. That is too early for some.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The filing process takes four months and needs five signatures.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, four months is a long time to wait.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, that explains the tension. One house is tired.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, if the window is tight, we need a rotation.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Rin, so the enclosed option is actually worse for smell?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Midori, the ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen in extra fees.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,I don't want to live next to a smelly box.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"We can afford the subsidy, but the maintenance is high.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The frontages are uneven. One is very narrow.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,Supervised mornings take fifty minutes. That is a lot of time.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,Nobody volunteered to turn away late bags at the meeting.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"So, what is left?","{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,We need a plan that doesn't break the bank or the peace.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,Rotating might be the only way to share the burden.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,I can handle a rotation if it is clear.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,A rotation ensures no one is stuck with it forever.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
